# AMD64 thunk export spec -- d3dx9_43.dll.
#
# The June 2010 SDK's D3DX9, and the single most-imported member of the
# family: anything built against the last DirectX SDK links this one.  From
# the 2026-08-17 everyday-DLL pass, and the same finding as its d3dx9_42
# sibling -- read dlls/d3dx9_42/d3dx9_42.thunks for the whole argument, the
# measured before/after, the two named refusals and the honest note about the
# interface half.  This file is that file's export list with a different
# D3DX_SDK_VERSION; everything said there applies here unchanged.
#
# The other thirty d3dx9_NN modules are one copy of this file each and are
# deliberately not added: each costs a clang oracle run of 300-odd exports at
# every build, and 24..41 and 43's siblings are pre-2007 SDKs.  When one is
# needed, this file plus a Makefile.in line is the whole change.
DLL d3dx9_43.dll
FROM-SPEC auto
PROBE-EXTRA   d3dx9.h
